    <string name="lg_help_title">Qanday qidiriladi</string>
    <string name="lg_help_text">Bitta qatorga istalganini aralash yozing — hammasi birga hisobga olinadi:\n\n• Tovar: pista, bodom, орик (lotin/kirill, xato yozilsa ham)\n• Miqdor: 40kg, 2,5 kg, 12 ta\n• Narx yoki summa: 200000, 200 000, 200k, 3,7mln, 15$\n• Summa chegarasi: &gt;1mln, &lt;500000, 1mln-5mln\n• Sana: 27.10, 27.10.2026, 27.10-29.10, 27 oktabr, oktabr, bugun, kecha\n• Vaqt: 16:21\n• Turi: savdo, vozvrat, to\'lov · valyuta: dollar, so\'m\n• Chiqarib tashlash: -pista\n\n\"pista 40\" — aynan 40 kg pista bo\'lgan savdolar. Aniq topilmasa eng yaqinlari \"taxminiy\" deb ko\'rsatiladi.</string>
